41647::$$$message_0321_0000_0000$$$::"Promo art, #4.[br]Saber's the last one."::
41648::$$$message_0321_0001_0000$$$::"...Rin. A word of advice, if I may."::
41649::$$$message_0321_0002_0000$$$::"Hm? You don't like it?"::
41650::$$$message_0321_0003_0000$$$::"No, just..."::
41651::$$$message_0321_0004_0000$$$::"Without my sword and armor, how will people know it's me right away? Won't it be counterproductive to advertising the title?"::
41652::$$$message_0321_0005_0000$$$::"There's plenty of other material that's serious enough.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01m(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01m(中)] Besides, there's plenty of stuff here to prove who you are, Saber.[humming]"U�1